0..77 Comment "/// A record whose last field is a record sharing a label with it prints, and"
78..104 Comment "/// reprints, as a record."
105..108 Comment "///"
109..184 Comment "/// The inner record\'s key binds its own field, so the outer record\'s label"
185..231 Comment "/// stays unread and its fields stay a record."
232..235 Comment "///"
236..313 Comment "/// The round trip reads each record type here back from its printed spelling"
314..360 Comment "/// and prints the reading as the same record."
361..364 Comment "///"
365..424 Comment "/// - see: #3010 — the reading printed again as a product"
